Go code adapted inside our own files. Each such file has the header line
"Portions Copyright The Go Authors (BSD-3-Clause; see NOTICE)", and the
passage itself is marked where it occurs:

- brainpool/curve.go: the elliptic.Curve methods, modelled on nistCurve in
  Go's src/crypto/elliptic/nistec.go.
- brainpool/ecdsa.go: encodeSignature, addASN1IntBytes and parseSignature,
  from Go's src/crypto/ecdsa/ecdsa.go.
