Project Wycheproof test vectors
-------------------------------

The files under ccm/testdata/wycheproof, kmac/testdata/wycheproof and
brainpool/testdata/wycheproof are test vector files of Project Wycheproof
(https://github.com/C2SP/wycheproof, testvectors_v1, commit
12fd3aaf33eb5fa1f52e026912ee00c054f9d984), compressed with gzip and
otherwise unchanged. They are Copyright Google LLC and the Wycheproof
contributors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the text is
in LICENSE). They keep that licence wherever they sit, including inside the
BSD-3-Clause directories ccm and brainpool. They are used only by tests.

Published values and test vectors
---------------------------------

Values and test vectors from published standards are used as facts and
cited where used; no standards text is reproduced. See PROVENANCE.md for
the list. One expected CCM value in ccm/ccm_test.go and the values in
ccm/testdata/reference.json were computed with the Python "cryptography"
package's AESCCM as an independent implementation;
some koblitz test keys were generated with OpenSSL; the SCRAM-SHA-512 and
-PLUS exchanges in sasl/plus_test.go were computed with Python's hashlib
and hmac.

